--- B. ADAPT TIMING CLARIFICATION (microseconds, mean +/- SD) ---
   Adapt checked total       176.549 +/-  1.036   (PROTOCOL: las_adapt above, incl. internal PreVerify)
   witness-add only            6.539 +/-  0.530   (DIAGNOSTIC ONLY: z=z_hat+r'; not a protocol op)
